    91       * @param connection The connection
    92       * @param response The response string. It is allocated by the connection
    93       *        and needs to be freed with connection->releaseBuffer
    94       * @param timeout Timeout of the recv operation in milliseconds
    95       * @return Returns UA_STATUSCODE_BADCOMMUNICATIONERROR if the recv operation
    96       *         can be repeated, UA_STATUSCODE_GOOD if it succeeded and
    97       *         UA_STATUSCODE_BADCONNECTIONCLOSED if the connection was
    98       *         closed. */
    99      UA_StatusCode (*recv)(UA_Connection *connection, UA_ByteString *response,
